## 1. Setup & Configuration

### Prerequisites

- **Go** 1.26 atau lebih baru
- **MySQL** 8.x atau MariaDB
- **Git**

### Instalasi

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/ehanz12/api-SneakHub.git
cd api-SneakHub

# Install dependencies
go mod download

# Setup environment
cp .env.example .env

# Buat database
mysql -u root -p -e "CREATE DATABASE sneakhub CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;"

# Jalankan server
go run main.go
```

Server berjalan di port `3000` (atau sesuai `PORT` di `.env`). Database akan otomatis di-migrasi dan di-seed (15 brand + 8 kategori).

### Konfigurasi Payment

Payment mode diatur via variabel `PAYMENT_MODE` di `.env`:

| `PAYMENT_MODE` | Deskripsi |
|---|---|
| `mock` | Simulasi pembayaran via `/api/mock-pay` & `/api/payments/mock-settle` |
| `tripay` | Tripay payment gateway |
| `midtrans` | Midtrans Snap payment gateway |

### Konfigurasi Shipping

Ongkir otomatis menggunakan **Biteship** (`BITESHIP_API_KEY` di `.env`). Jika key kosong, toko belum isi `kode_pos_asal`, atau service error, ongkir menggunakan flat rate **Rp15.000**.

> **Tip:** Isi `BITESHIP_API_KEY` dan pastikan toko sudah isi `kode_pos_asal`, `kota_asal`, dan `alamat_asal` untuk kalkulasi ongkir akurat. Tersedia kurir: JNE, SiCepat, AnterAja, J&T.

### Rate Limiting

Maksimal **200 request/menit per IP** (return status `429`).

---

## 2. Authentication & Roles

All endpoints (except those marked *Public*) require this header:

```
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

Obtain your token via **Register** or **Login** (valid for 7 days). JWT claims include: `user_id`, `role`, `exp`.

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| `customer` | Shopping: wishlist, cart, addresses, checkout, orders, reviews, notifications |
| `seller` | Store management: products, orders, dashboard, price predictions |
| `admin` | User/product/order management, moderation, reports, categories |

### Route Access Summary

| Route Group | Allowed Roles |
|---|---|
| `auth/*`, `payments/*`, `mock-pay/*` | **Public** (no token required) |
| `users/me`, `discovery/*`, `home/*`, `recommendation/*`, `trending`, `best-seller/*`, `products` (GET), `category` (GET), `notifications/*`, `orders` (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE) | **All roles** |
| `wishlist/*`, `carts/*`, `addresses/*`, `checkout`, `orders/:id/review` | **customer** only |
| `seller/*` (dashboard, products, orders), `price/prediction` | **seller** only |
| `admin/*`, `category` (POST/PUT/DELETE) | **admin** only |
| `products` (POST/PUT/DELETE), `products/:id/images` (POST/DELETE), `products/:id/condition-score` (POST) | **seller & admin** |

> **Note:** Auth middleware returns `{"error": "..."}`, which differs from the standard `{success, message, data, errors}` envelope used by other handlers.

---

## 3. Response Format & Errors

### Successful Responses

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Indonesian message",
  "data": { ... } | [ ... ] | null
}
```

### Validation Errors (HTTP 422)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "validation errors",
  "errors": { "field": "error message" }
}
```

### Other Error Status Codes

| Status | Response Format |
|---|---|
| 400 Bad Request | `{ "success": false, "errors": "<message>" }` |
| 401 Unauthorized (invalid/expired token) | `{ "error": "..." }` |
| 403 Forbidden (wrong role) | `{ "error": "access denied for role: ..." }` |
| 404 Not Found | `{ "success": false, "message": "..." }` |
| 429 Rate Limit | `{ "status": "error", "message": "..." }` |

> **Important:** Auth middleware returns `{"error": "..."}`, which is different from the standard `{success, message, data, errors}` envelope used by other handlers.

### Pagination (when data is a list)

```json
{
  "page": 1,
  "limit": 20,
  "total": 100,
  "total_pages": 5
}
```

---

## 4. Fitur per Domain

### 4.1 Auth & User

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Deskripsi |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Public | Registrasi customer baru |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Login semua role |
| GET | `/api/users/me` | Semua | Profil sendiri |
| PUT | `/api/users/me` | Semua | Update profil sendiri |

**Register** — `201`

```json
{
  "nama": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "nomor_telepon": "08123456789"
}
```

- `nama` wajib, `email` wajib (harus mengandung `@`), `password` wajib (min 6 karakter), `nomor_telepon` opsional (format HP Indonesia valid).
- Respons: `data.user` (user_id, nama, email, nomor_telepon, peran, status_akun) + `data.access_token`.

**Login** — `200`

```json
{ "email": "budi@mail.com", "password": "rahasia123" }
```

Respons: `data.access_token` + `data.user` (user_id, nama, email, peran).

**Update Me** — `200`

```json
{
  "nama": "Budi Santoso Baru",
  "nomor_telepon": "081298765432",
  "preferensi_ukuran": ["42", "43"],
  "brand_favorit": ["Nike", "Adidas"]
}
```

`preferensi_ukuran` dan `brand_favorit` dipakai untuk personalisasi konten home & rekomendasi (lihat 4.4).

---

### 4.2 Seller (Store)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/users/me/seller-activation` | All | Activate account as seller |
| GET | `/api/seller/me` | seller | Your own store profile |
| PUT | `/api/seller/me` | seller | Update your own store profile |
| GET | `/api/seller/products` | seller | Products owned by your store |
| GET | `/api/seller/orders` | seller | Incoming orders to your store |
| POST | `/api/seller/orders/:order_id/ship` | seller | Ship order (automatic Biteship resi) |
| GET | `/api/seller/dashboard` | seller | Store statistics |
| GET | `/api/sellers/:seller_id/trust-score` | All | Seller trust score |
| GET | `/api/sellers/:seller_id/reviews` | All | Store reviews & ratings |

#### Seller Activation — `201`

```json
{
  "nama_toko": "Toko Sepatu Budi",
  "deskripsi_toko": "Menjual sepatu sneaker original dan second berkualitas",
  "kode_pos_asal": "12560",
  "kota_asal": "Jakarta Selatan",
  "alamat_asal": "Jl. Merdeka No. 45"
}
```

**Requirements:** `nama_toko` is required (min 3 chars), `deskripsi_toko` is optional (min 3 chars), `kode_pos_asal` is optional (must be 5 digits), `kota_asal` is optional (min 2 chars), `alamat_asal` is optional (min 5 chars).

**Important:** Verification is handled only by **admin**. If rejected (`REJECTED`), the user can reapply by sending the same endpoint again (store data will be updated).

> **Note:** For automatic shipping cost calculation and **Biteship courier booking**, the store must fill `kode_pos_asal`, `kota_asal`, and `alamat_asal`. This can be done during activation or later via **Store Profile Update**.

#### Store Profile — `200` (GET) / `200` (PUT)

`GET /api/seller/me` returns your store profile in the same format as the activation response. `status_verifikasi` is returned in English format (`VERIFIED`/`REJECTED`/`PENDING`). Optional fields (`deskripsi_toko`, `kode_pos_asal`, `kota_asal`, `alamat_asal`) are **omitted from JSON when NULL** — the frontend should treat missing fields as empty/null.

`PUT /api/seller/me` — **partial update**: only sent fields are changed; sending a field as empty (`""`) will delete it (set to NULL).

```json
{
  "kode_pos_asal": "40161",
  "alamat_asal": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 8"
}
```

**Updatable fields:** `nama_toko` (min 3), `deskripsi_toko` (min 3), `kode_pos_asal` (5 digits), `kota_asal` (min 2), `alamat_asal` (min 5).

**Requirement:** At least one field must be sent.

#### Seller Dashboard — `200`

```json
{
  "total_produk": 12,
  "produk_aktif": 10,
  "total_terjual": 45,
  "total_pendapatan": 67500000,
  "rating_rata_rata": 4.7,
  "seller_trust_score": 92.5,
  "produk_terlaris": [{ "product_id": "...", "nama_produk": "...", "total_terjual": 8 }]
}
```

#### Trust Score — `200`

`GET /api/sellers/:seller_id/trust-score` returns `seller_id`, `skor_akhir`, `order_completion_rate`, `average_rating`, `cancellation_rate`, `response_rate`. This score is used in the smart-filter matching (see section 4.4).

---

### 4.3 Admin (Moderation & Reports)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/admin/users` | admin | List all users |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/users/:user_id/status` | admin | Change user account status |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/users/:user_id/role` | admin | Change user role (customer ↔ seller) |
| GET | `/api/admin/sellers` | admin | List seller registration requests |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/sellers/:seller_id/verification` | admin | Approve/reject store application |
| GET | `/api/admin/products` | admin | List all products |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/products/:product_id/status` | admin | Change product publication status |
| GET | `/api/admin/orders` | admin | List all orders |
| GET | `/api/admin/reports` | admin | Aggregate platform reports |

#### Change User Status — `200`

```json
{ "status_akun": "SUSPENDED", "alasan": "Melanggar ketentuan marketplace" }
```

**Account status values:** `ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`, `SUSPENDED`, `BLOCKED`. `alasan` (reason) is required.

#### Change User Role — `200`

```json
{ "peran": "CUSTOMER" }
```

**Role values:** `SELLER`, `CUSTOMER`. Admin role cannot be lowered.

- `SELLER`: User becomes a seller, store status becomes `VERIFIED` immediately.
- `CUSTOMER` (downgrading seller): Store in `sellers` table becomes `REJECTED`, all products become `INACTIVE` (cannot be purchased; existing orders still work), and the user receives a notification. The new role takes effect immediately without requiring re-login (middleware reads role from database).

#### Store Applications List — `200`

`GET /api/admin/sellers?status=pending&page=1&limit=20` returns `items[{seller_id, user_id, nama_toko, status_verifikasi, nama_user, email, created_at}]` with pagination. Optional `status` filter: `PENDING`, `VERIFIED`, `REJECTED`.

#### Approve/Reject Store Application — `200`

```json
{ "status": "VERIFIED" }
```

**Status values:** `VERIFIED` (user automatically becomes seller + notification) or `REJECTED` (user remains customer, can reapply). Only `PENDING` applications can be verified.

#### Change Product Status — `200`

```json
{ "status_publikasi": "ACTIVE", "catatan": "Produk lolos moderasi" }
```

**Publication status values:** `ACTIVE`, `DRAFT`, `INACTIVE`, `PENDING`. `catatan` (note) is required. Moderation flow: seller creates product (`PENDING`) → admin approves (`ACTIVE`).

#### Admin Reports — `200`

`GET /api/admin/reports?period=monthly&start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31` returns `period`, `total_users`, `total_sellers`, `total_products`, `total_orders`, `total_revenue`.

---

### 4.4 Discovery & AI

Smart search & recommendation features based on user preferences and light machine learning.

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/discovery/smart-filter` | All | Smart product filtering with weights |
| GET | `/api/home/personalized` | All | Personalized home content |
| GET | `/api/recommendation/cocok-untuk-kamu` | All | Personal recommendations |
| GET | `/api/trending` | All | Trending products |
| GET | `/api/best-seller/weekly` | All | Weekly best sellers |
| POST | `/api/price/prediction` | seller | Price prediction |

#### Smart Filter — `200`

```json
{
  "budget_min": 500000,
  "budget_max": 3000000,
  "brand": ["Nike", "Adidas"],
  "ukuran": ["42", "43"],
  "kondisi": ["NEW", "USED"],
  "kategori": ["Sneakers"],
  "prioritas": { "harga": 0.5, "kondisi": 0.3, "seller_trust": 0.2 }
}
```

**Priority weights** (`prioritas`): These are importance weights (must not be negative); `budget_max` must be ≥ `budget_min`.

**Response:** `items[{product_id, nama_produk, harga, match_score, alasan[]}]` — `match_score` (0–100) is calculated from the weights, and `alasan[]` explains why products are recommended.

> **Pro tip:** Adjust the `prioritas` weights to favor price, condition, or seller trustworthiness depending on what matters most to you at the moment.

#### Home Personalized — `200`

Response: `sections[{type, title, products[{product_id, nama_produk, harga, image_url}]}]` — content sections like "Rekomendasi untuk kamu", "Brand favoritmu", "Kategori yang kamu sukai", built from `preferensi_ukuran` & `brand_favorit`.

#### Rekomendasi Cocok Untuk Kamu — `200`

`GET /api/recommendation/cocok-untuk-kamu?limit=10` returns `items[{product_id, nama_produk, harga, score, reason}]`.

#### Trending — `200`

`GET /api/trending?period=weekly&limit=10` returns `period`, `items[{product_id, nama_produk, trend_score, views, wishlist_count}]` — calculated from view and wishlist counts in the period.

#### Best Seller Mingguan — `200`

`GET /api/best-seller/weekly?limit=10` returns `period_start`, `period_end`, `items[{rank, product_id, nama_produk, total_terjual}]`.

#### Price Prediction (Seller) — `200`

```json
{
  "brand_id": "uuid-brand",
  "category_id": "uuid-kategori",
  "kondisi": "USED",
  "condition_score": 85,
  "ukuran": "42",
  "model": "Air Jordan 1 High",
  "tahun_rilis": 2021
}
```

**Requirements:** `brand_id` is required; `kondisi`: `NEW`/`USED`/`REFURBISHED`; `condition_score` 0–100; `tahun_rilis` ≥ 1900.

**Response:** `estimated_market_price_min`, `estimated_market_price_max`, `recommended_price`, `confidence` — helps sellers determine their selling price.

