### 4.5 Category

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/category` | All | List categories |
| POST | `/api/category` | admin | Create category |
| PUT | `/api/category/:category_id` | admin | Update category |
| DELETE | `/api/category/:category_id` | admin | Delete category |

Body (POST/PUT): `{ "nama_kategori": "Sneakers" }` (min 3 characters).

> **Note:** The category list response returns the ID field as `category_id` (a minor typo in the code). Documentation reflects the actual behavior.

Body requirements: `nama_kategori` is required with minimum 3 characters.

