| POST | `/api/wishlist/:product_id/price-alert` | customer | Set price alert |
| DELETE | `/api/wishlist/:product_id/price-alert` | customer | Disable price alert |
| POST | `/api/wishlist/:product_id/restock-alert` | customer | Set stock alert |
| DELETE | `/api/wishlist/:product_id/restock-alert` | customer | Disable stock alert |

#### Add to Wishlist — `201`

```json
{ "product_id": "uuid" }
```

**Minimum:** 1 item.

#### Price Alert — `200`

```json
{ "target_price": 750000 }
```

You'll be notified when the product price drops below `target_price`.

#### Restock Alert — `200` (no body)

Notification when stock becomes available again.

#### Wishlist List Response

```json
[
  {
    "wishlist_id": "uuid",
    "product_id": "uuid",
    "nama_produk": "...",
    "harga": 1500000,
    "status_stok_terakhir": "AVAILABLE",
    "price_alert": { "enabled": true, "target_price": 750000 },
    "restock_alert": { "enabled": true }
  }
]
```
```

