| GET | `/api/notifications` | All | List notifications |
| PATCH | `/api/notifications/:notification_id/read` | All | Mark as read |

Notifications are created automatically by the system (e.g., price drops, stock availability, order progress, etc.).

#### List Notifications — `200`

`GET /api/notifications?page=1&limit=20&type=PRICE_ALERT` returns `items[{notification_id, jenis_notifikasi, isi_notifikasi, status_baca, created_at}]` plus `unread_count` (number of unread notifications).

#### Mark as Read — `200`

`{notification_id, status_baca}`

