### 4.10 Address (Shipping Address)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/addresses` | customer | List your addresses |
| GET | `/api/addresses/:address_id` | customer | Address detail |
| POST | `/api/addresses` | customer | Create new address |
| PUT | `/api/addresses/:address_id` | customer | Update address |
| DELETE | `/api/addresses/:address_id` | customer | Delete address |

#### Create Address — `201`

```json
{
  "nama_penerima": "Budi Santoso",
  "nomor_telepon": "08123456789",
  "alamat": "Jl. Merdeka No. 45, RT 02/RW 05",
  "kota": "Jakarta Selatan",
  "provinsi": "DKI Jakarta",
  "kode_pos": "12560",
  "is_default": true
}
```

**Required:** `nama_penerima`, `alamat`, `kota`, `provinsi`, `kode_pos`.

`is_default=true` makes this address the default for checkout.

#### Update Address — `200`

Send a subset of fields (minimum 1 required field); all fields are optional per-field.

